WEBVTT

00:00:10.940 --> 00:00:19.320
A light so bright that it can't be hidden
Breaks the silence and resurrects in this world

00:00:20.980 --> 00:00:30.070
The dry land quakes violently
Sparks clash as we risk our lives

00:00:31.730 --> 00:00:37.810
Let a miracle occur, just one more time

00:00:37.900 --> 00:00:44.950
The power to regain the pages of memories I lost long ago

00:00:45.870 --> 00:00:53.020
The trusting heart pierces the darkness
Search for the place where the soul rests

00:00:53.150 --> 00:00:59.250
The sharp glint in my unblinking eye burns

00:00:59.550 --> 00:01:06.700
Two souls - light and shadow
To the future shown in the crystal

00:01:06.890 --> 00:01:13.310
Now moving  Overflowing in red  eyes

00:01:27.920 --> 00:01:30.880
The KC Grand Prix semifinals have started.

00:01:30.880 --> 00:01:35.040
Sieg quickly qualifies for the finals.

00:01:35.040 --> 00:01:41.740
Rebecca and Leon use all their strategies in a fierce duel, neither side backing down.

00:01:41.740 --> 00:01:48.590
I want to go cheer for her, but someone kidnapped my Grandpa!

00:01:48.590 --> 00:01:52.280
Just wait, Grandpa!  We're coming to rescue you!

00:01:52.280 --> 00:01:58.290
Leon in Fairyland

00:02:25.120 --> 00:02:26.850
Looks delicious!

00:02:27.500 --> 00:02:29.760
Shark fin soup!  Shrimp with chili sauce!

00:02:29.760 --> 00:02:32.240
There’s also Peking Duck!

00:02:47.930 --> 00:02:49.190
What?

00:02:50.410 --> 00:02:51.780
That's...

00:02:51.780 --> 00:02:52.720
Vivian?

00:03:08.370 --> 00:03:09.920
How's she doing that?

00:03:11.100 --> 00:03:12.120
Over there!

00:03:18.060 --> 00:03:19.090
Grandpa!

00:03:19.680 --> 00:03:21.570
Sugoroku?

00:03:21.570 --> 00:03:23.550
What are you doing, Grandpa?

00:03:23.550 --> 00:03:26.010
Well...  Umm...

00:03:34.070 --> 00:03:37.570
Grandpa, that hurt!

00:03:38.500 --> 00:03:41.070
I’m sorry, Vivi.

00:03:41.070 --> 00:03:42.460
Vivi?

00:03:42.460 --> 00:03:45.480
Grandpa!  Tell us what’s going on!

00:03:45.480 --> 00:03:48.080
We were worried about you!

00:03:48.080 --> 00:03:51.590
Well it’s...  Umm...

00:03:51.590 --> 00:03:54.200
Forget about Grandpa!

00:03:54.200 --> 00:03:56.790
This is an issue between Yugi and me.

00:04:07.430 --> 00:04:08.860
What?

00:04:09.660 --> 00:04:13.380
This is the true arena for the KC Grand Prix's finals!

00:04:13.380 --> 00:04:16.670
The sacred ground where Yugi and I will duel!

00:04:19.900 --> 00:04:21.190
You kiddin' me?

00:04:21.190 --> 00:04:24.730
You lost to Rebecca in the first round!

00:04:24.730 --> 00:04:29.190
Only the winner of the KC Grand Prix can duel Yugi!

00:04:30.020 --> 00:04:31.660
Silence!

00:04:31.660 --> 00:04:36.650
As long as both parties want to duel, they can duel anytime, anywhere!

00:04:36.650 --> 00:04:38.190
Right, Yugi?

00:04:38.620 --> 00:04:41.820
Sorry, but I won't duel you.

00:04:43.310 --> 00:04:45.310
Don’t say that, Yugi.

00:04:45.310 --> 00:04:47.680
Please duel against Vivi.

00:04:49.810 --> 00:04:52.820
Grandpa, did she seduce you?

00:04:53.670 --> 00:04:56.940
No, I have a good reason.

00:05:08.670 --> 00:05:09.960
Mr. Rock?

00:05:09.960 --> 00:05:12.960
No, I mean Sugoroku Muto.

00:05:14.480 --> 00:05:15.460
You’re...

00:05:16.030 --> 00:05:20.960
Sugoroku, you’re Yugi’s grandfather, right?

00:05:22.270 --> 00:05:23.960
Yes I am.

00:05:23.960 --> 00:05:28.720
Wow!  Can you do me a favor?

00:05:28.720 --> 00:05:33.480
Even if I wanted to, my back hurts.

00:05:33.480 --> 00:05:36.990
If I fix your back, will you do it?

00:05:37.920 --> 00:05:39.480
Of course!

00:05:39.480 --> 00:05:42.160
Really?  That’s a promise!

00:05:51.250 --> 00:05:53.460
My back doesn’t hurt anymore.

00:05:55.470 --> 00:06:00.200
Vivi fixed my back, so I owe her.

00:06:00.200 --> 00:06:02.510
That can't be the whole story.

00:06:02.510 --> 00:06:04.940
He clearly has a secret motive.

00:06:04.940 --> 00:06:06.520
How dare you!

00:06:06.520 --> 00:06:09.220
Grandpa, you're dishonorable!

00:06:10.680 --> 00:06:13.240
I'm no longer your student!

00:06:13.240 --> 00:06:14.720
Grandpa...

00:06:14.720 --> 00:06:17.220
So you won’t duel her?

00:06:17.220 --> 00:06:20.540
Unacceptable!  Not after coming this far!

00:06:26.130 --> 00:06:27.960
My back...

00:06:27.960 --> 00:06:30.480
What did you do?

00:06:30.480 --> 00:06:33.030
I returned him to his original state.

00:06:33.030 --> 00:06:34.970
Are you okay, Grandpa?

00:06:34.970 --> 00:06:40.970
Yugi!  If you want me to fix your grandpa’s back, duel me!

00:06:41.840 --> 00:06:43.710
That’s dirty!

00:06:43.710 --> 00:06:47.680
I'll do anything for love.

00:06:49.760 --> 00:06:52.160
A love that grows from dueling.

00:06:52.160 --> 00:06:54.220
Isn’t that beautiful?

00:06:54.220 --> 00:06:56.720
You’re an idiot!

00:06:56.720 --> 00:06:58.210
Don’t do it, Yugi.

00:06:58.210 --> 00:07:00.360
You don’t have to duel her.

00:07:04.420 --> 00:07:05.540
Grandpa...

00:07:06.120 --> 00:07:07.150
Partner.

00:07:07.150 --> 00:07:08.650
My other self.

00:07:08.650 --> 00:07:11.240
Our only choice is to help him.

00:07:11.240 --> 00:07:12.240
Sorry about this.

00:07:21.250 --> 00:07:23.000
For Grandpa...

00:07:25.010 --> 00:07:26.490
I’ll duel you!

00:07:26.490 --> 00:07:28.340
That’s the spirit!

00:07:28.340 --> 00:07:30.480
But there's one condition.

00:07:30.480 --> 00:07:34.000
Yugi, if you lose, you become my servant.

00:07:34.000 --> 00:07:36.230
My love servant.

00:07:36.230 --> 00:07:38.010
What's with you!

00:07:38.010 --> 00:07:40.610
This is the real finals?  Whatever!

00:07:40.610 --> 00:07:42.430
Servant?  Whatever!

00:07:42.430 --> 00:07:45.170
Stop talking nonsense!

00:07:45.170 --> 00:07:46.740
Anzu...

00:07:46.740 --> 00:07:49.990
I don’t mind.  Because I’m going to win!

00:07:49.990 --> 00:07:51.680
Yugi...

00:07:51.680 --> 00:07:52.790
That’s right.

00:07:52.790 --> 00:07:55.990
End this quick so we can go root for Becky.

00:07:55.990 --> 00:07:58.460
Keep talking!

00:07:58.460 --> 00:08:02.490
I'll show you China’s 4000 years of dueling!

00:08:07.960 --> 00:08:09.010
Duel!

00:08:18.010 --> 00:08:20.350
My turn!  I draw!

00:08:21.010 --> 00:08:24.410
I activate Pot of Greed from my hand!

00:08:24.410 --> 00:08:26.900
I draw two cards from my deck!

00:08:27.520 --> 00:08:32.590
I summon Witch of the Black Forest in attack position!

00:08:35.030 --> 00:08:39.440
Witch of the Black Forest, destroy Pumpkin Carriage!

00:08:42.540 --> 00:08:46.690
Now Prinzessin can't attack me directly.

00:08:46.690 --> 00:08:48.040
I end my turn!

00:08:48.040 --> 00:08:50.480
My turn!  I draw!

00:08:50.840 --> 00:08:54.240
Prinzessin attacks Witch of the Black Forest!

00:09:04.620 --> 00:09:07.620
Witch of the Black Forest’s effect activates!

00:09:07.620 --> 00:09:10.220
When it's placed in the graveyard...

00:09:10.220 --> 00:09:15.090
...I add a monster with 1500 or lower defense points from my deck to my hand.

00:09:15.090 --> 00:09:16.640
I’m not done!

00:09:16.640 --> 00:09:20.070
I summon Tom Thumb in defense position!

00:09:20.070 --> 00:09:22.570
I also set one card.

00:09:22.570 --> 00:09:24.290
I end my turn.

00:09:24.940 --> 00:09:27.080
My turn!  I draw!

00:09:27.080 --> 00:09:30.940
I summon Ruby Dragon in attack position!

00:09:33.760 --> 00:09:38.490
I activate the spell card, Dragon's Gunfire from my hand!

00:09:41.760 --> 00:09:49.290
Dragon's Gunfire destroys a faceup monster with 800 or lower defense points!

00:09:55.880 --> 00:10:00.400
Next, Ruby Dragon attacks Tom Thumb!

00:10:01.710 --> 00:10:04.190
I flip over my set card!

00:10:04.190 --> 00:10:06.150
Negate Attack!

00:10:08.420 --> 00:10:11.880
It negates your attack and ends the Battle Phase.

00:10:12.480 --> 00:10:15.400
I set two cards and end my turn.

00:10:15.400 --> 00:10:17.800
He really is tough!

00:10:21.910 --> 00:10:24.100
Yugi, where are you?

00:10:24.100 --> 00:10:25.590
Rebecca!  Don’t lose!

00:10:25.590 --> 00:10:26.400
Do your best!

00:10:26.400 --> 00:10:27.900
Fight!

00:10:27.900 --> 00:10:30.920
Oh yeah.  I'm not alone.

00:10:30.920 --> 00:10:32.680
They're cheering for me.

00:10:33.410 --> 00:10:35.150
Rebecca, do your best!

00:10:36.400 --> 00:10:37.520
I won’t lose!

00:10:38.480 --> 00:10:40.160
My turn!  I draw!

00:10:40.160 --> 00:10:45.160
I activate the spell card, Giant's Training from my hand!

00:10:45.160 --> 00:10:50.060
I tribute Tom Thumb, which has been on my field for at least one turn.

00:10:50.060 --> 00:10:53.400
I summon Globerman in attack position!

00:10:53.400 --> 00:10:56.500
Globerman attacks Ruby Dragon!

00:11:11.640 --> 00:11:13.300
I flip over my set card!

00:11:13.300 --> 00:11:14.880
Rope of Life!

00:11:14.880 --> 00:11:17.620
When a battle sends a monster to the graveyard...

00:11:17.620 --> 00:11:20.040
...I discard my hand to activate it!

00:11:20.040 --> 00:11:24.780
I Special Summon the monster and raise its attack points by 800!

00:11:24.780 --> 00:11:26.760
I have 0 cards in my hand!

00:11:26.760 --> 00:11:29.880
I Special Summon Ruby Dragon!

00:11:32.400 --> 00:11:34.620
I flip over another set card!

00:11:34.620 --> 00:11:36.280
Adamantine Sword Revival!

00:11:36.280 --> 00:11:40.810
I tribute a Special Summoned Dragon-Type monster!

00:11:40.810 --> 00:11:45.060
I Special Summon Diamond Head Dragon from my deck!

00:11:54.060 --> 00:12:02.820
Diamond Head Dragon’s attack points are equal to the tributed monster's attack points plus 1000!

00:12:02.820 --> 00:12:05.260
3400 attack points.

00:12:05.260 --> 00:12:06.480
How’s that?

00:12:06.480 --> 00:12:07.800
I end my turn.

00:12:08.520 --> 00:12:10.300
I won’t lose!

00:12:29.400 --> 00:12:31.260
This is delicious!

00:12:31.260 --> 00:12:33.540
This mapo tofu is exquisite!

00:12:34.980 --> 00:12:37.260
What are you doing!

00:12:37.260 --> 00:12:39.400
Cheer for Yugi!

00:12:39.400 --> 00:12:42.280
C'mon, we know Yugi is going to win.

00:12:43.400 --> 00:12:44.940
Anzu, eat up.

00:12:44.940 --> 00:12:46.260
It’s delicious!

00:12:47.180 --> 00:12:48.380
Really?

00:12:48.380 --> 00:12:49.280
Delish!

00:12:51.020 --> 00:12:54.380
It seems Vivian drew a key card!

00:12:54.380 --> 00:13:01.740
I tribute Master Kyonshee and Kung Fu Nyan Nyan and activate the spell card, Luminous Clouds.

00:13:02.900 --> 00:13:06.280
I Special Summon Dragon Lady in attack position!

00:13:06.280 --> 00:13:10.900
I can't Special Summon other monsters this turn.

00:13:10.900 --> 00:13:12.300
However...

00:13:12.300 --> 00:13:16.060
I activate the Equip Spell, Lightning Saber from my hand!

00:13:18.560 --> 00:13:22.210
Dragon Lady gains 300 attack points!

00:13:23.040 --> 00:13:27.340
Dragon Lady attacks Dark Magician!

00:13:36.340 --> 00:13:38.520
What?  It attacked twice?

00:13:38.520 --> 00:13:46.160
When equipped with Lightning Saber, it can halve its attack points to attack again.

00:13:46.160 --> 00:13:47.760
I end my turn.

00:13:47.760 --> 00:13:50.020
My turn!  I draw!

00:13:51.180 --> 00:13:55.760
I summon Big Shield Gardna in defense position!

00:13:56.780 --> 00:13:59.800
I set one card and end my turn.

00:14:00.300 --> 00:14:02.420
Is Yugi okay?

00:14:02.420 --> 00:14:03.900
He seems to be losing.

00:14:03.900 --> 00:14:07.040
Say what!  No he's not!

00:14:07.040 --> 00:14:09.680
My turn!  I draw!

00:14:09.680 --> 00:14:13.200
Dragon Lady attacks Big Shield Gardna!

00:14:15.060 --> 00:14:17.070
I flip over my set card!

00:14:17.070 --> 00:14:19.580
Mirror Force!

00:14:19.580 --> 00:14:22.250
My Quick-Play Spell, Snowfall Sword!

00:14:22.250 --> 00:14:26.250
I can activate it when a Warrior has an Equip Spell!

00:14:26.250 --> 00:14:30.590
It negates and destroys your spell or trap!

00:14:40.720 --> 00:14:42.490
Isn’t this bad?

00:14:42.490 --> 00:14:45.970
The second attack will attack him directly.

00:14:45.970 --> 00:14:50.480
I activate the spell card, Flying Dragon Whirl from my hand!

00:14:50.480 --> 00:14:54.980
By sending four Dragons in my deck to the graveyard...

00:14:54.980 --> 00:14:58.550
...Dragon Lady gains 1200 attack points!

00:15:04.180 --> 00:15:05.190
Oh no!

00:15:05.190 --> 00:15:06.220
No way!

00:15:06.220 --> 00:15:09.320
Dragon Lady attacks you directly!

00:15:10.220 --> 00:15:12.720
Oh my!  I won!

00:15:16.730 --> 00:15:18.300
Are you sure?

00:15:22.380 --> 00:15:27.960
By discarding Kuriboh from my hand, I take 0 damage!

00:15:31.190 --> 00:15:33.980
I was so close!

00:15:33.980 --> 00:15:36.200
I have to wait until my next turn.

00:15:36.200 --> 00:15:37.480
I end my turn!

00:15:37.900 --> 00:15:39.480
You won't get another turn.

00:15:40.500 --> 00:15:43.980
I'll defeat you this turn, Vivian!

00:15:43.980 --> 00:15:45.900
T-There’s no way you can-

00:15:45.900 --> 00:15:48.190
My turn!  I draw!

00:15:49.230 --> 00:15:54.270
I summon Skilled Dark Magician in attack position!

00:15:56.590 --> 00:15:59.000
I activate Pot of Greed!

00:15:59.000 --> 00:16:01.560
I draw two cards from my deck!

00:16:04.040 --> 00:16:07.780
I activate Emblem of Dragon Destroyer from my hand!

00:16:07.780 --> 00:16:11.810
I add Buster Blader from my graveyard to my hand!

00:16:14.220 --> 00:16:15.520
What’s that light?

00:16:15.520 --> 00:16:17.500
It's a Spell Counter.

00:16:17.500 --> 00:16:20.530
It gains one every time a spell card is activated.

00:16:21.720 --> 00:16:22.760
I'm not done.

00:16:22.760 --> 00:16:26.760
I activate the spell card, Monster Reincarnation from my hand!

00:16:26.760 --> 00:16:30.770
I can return a monster in the graveyard to the deck!

00:16:31.520 --> 00:16:34.280
I choose Dark Magician!

00:16:35.760 --> 00:16:39.540
When Skilled Dark Magician has 3 Spell Counters...

00:16:39.540 --> 00:16:46.780
...I can tribute it to Special Summon Dark Magician in attack position!

00:16:46.780 --> 00:16:52.080
I fuse Dark Magician on my field with Buster Blader in my hand!

00:16:58.790 --> 00:17:04.040
Come forth, Dark Paladin!

00:17:07.030 --> 00:17:16.040
Dark Paladin gains 500 attack points for every Dragon on the field and in our graveyards!

00:17:16.040 --> 00:17:22.040
No way!  I just sent four dragons to the graveyard!

00:17:25.560 --> 00:17:29.190
Dark Paladin attacks Dragon Lady!

00:17:30.730 --> 00:17:33.020
Super Magical Wave Slash!

00:17:41.300 --> 00:17:42.900
He did it!

00:17:42.900 --> 00:17:44.310
As expected!

00:17:49.890 --> 00:17:53.310
As you promised, please fix my grandpa’s back.

00:17:56.320 --> 00:17:58.320
Yugi...

00:18:07.060 --> 00:18:07.980
Rebecca!

00:18:08.810 --> 00:18:09.890
Darling!

00:18:09.890 --> 00:18:11.190
We came too!

00:18:11.190 --> 00:18:12.840
Rebecca, do your best!

00:18:12.840 --> 00:18:13.980
Everyone!

00:18:14.590 --> 00:18:15.600
Yugi!

00:18:15.600 --> 00:18:18.210
Are you okay, Rebecca?

00:18:18.210 --> 00:18:20.110
You only have 100 life points.

00:18:20.110 --> 00:18:21.600
I’ll be fine!

00:18:21.600 --> 00:18:24.240
Because my darling's here to cheer me on!

00:18:24.240 --> 00:18:25.190
Do your best!

00:18:25.840 --> 00:18:28.180
My turn!  I draw!

00:18:28.180 --> 00:18:32.210
Diamond Head Dragon attacks Globerman!

00:18:39.800 --> 00:18:41.150
She did it!

00:18:41.150 --> 00:18:42.800
This match is up for grabs!

00:18:42.800 --> 00:18:43.800
Rebecca!

00:18:44.120 --> 00:18:46.800
I set one card and end my turn!

00:18:47.720 --> 00:18:50.120
The set card is Dragon's Rage.

00:18:50.120 --> 00:18:59.920
My monster can deal piercing damage if its attack points are higher than his defense points.

00:19:00.580 --> 00:19:06.080
As long as he doesn’t summon a monster with 2500 or higher defense points, I win.

00:19:06.080 --> 00:19:08.340
My turn!  I draw!

00:19:08.900 --> 00:19:12.930
I activate the spell card, Gold Moon Coin from my hand!

00:19:12.930 --> 00:19:14.330
I’ll give you this.

00:19:14.900 --> 00:19:19.970
I can activate Gold Moon Coin by giving you the remaining cards in my hand.

00:19:20.440 --> 00:19:24.460
Then I draw the same number of cards from my deck.

00:19:25.620 --> 00:19:27.470
Spinning Wheel Spindle?

00:19:27.470 --> 00:19:32.330
But you can use this card to destroy my monster.

00:19:32.330 --> 00:19:39.800
If you summon a monster with at least 900 attack points next turn, I'll lose anyway.

00:19:39.800 --> 00:19:42.270
So I'll bet on the future.

00:19:42.270 --> 00:19:43.260
Leon...

00:19:43.260 --> 00:19:44.560
Leon...

00:19:45.080 --> 00:19:49.270
I sense quiet - but incredible - spirit from him.

00:19:49.270 --> 00:19:51.760
Here I go, Rebecca!

00:19:51.760 --> 00:19:56.510
I activate the spell card, 100-Year Awakening from my hand!

00:19:56.510 --> 00:19:57.630
What?

00:19:58.240 --> 00:20:01.240
I tribute Curse of Thorns.

00:20:03.740 --> 00:20:07.240
To Special Summon Thorn Princess from my deck!

00:20:07.250 --> 00:20:09.240
Thorn Princess?

00:20:09.250 --> 00:20:11.650
W-What's going to happen?

00:20:18.260 --> 00:20:21.130
I activate Thorn Princess’s effect!

00:20:21.130 --> 00:20:24.760
When it’s summoned, I gain control of one of your monsters!

00:20:24.760 --> 00:20:26.130
No way!

00:20:32.770 --> 00:20:36.840
Diamond Head Dragon attacks you directly!

00:20:41.410 --> 00:20:42.860
Rebecca!

00:20:46.920 --> 00:20:51.420
Master Seto, we've finished our investigation on Sieg Lloyd.

00:20:52.320 --> 00:20:55.930
Like I thought, you're the rat.

00:20:59.010 --> 00:21:01.440
I’m sorry, Rebecca.

00:21:01.440 --> 00:21:03.270
Why are you apologizing?

00:21:03.930 --> 00:21:05.430
Congrats.

00:21:05.430 --> 00:21:08.840
Make sure you win the finals so you can duel Yugi.

00:21:09.670 --> 00:21:11.070
Rebecca...

00:21:11.070 --> 00:21:14.000
Sometimes, she's all right.

00:21:14.000 --> 00:21:15.680
She’s more gracious than you.

00:21:19.920 --> 00:21:22.420
Rebecca, you did well.

00:21:22.420 --> 00:21:23.960
Darling...

00:21:27.130 --> 00:21:30.440
Darling, I lost because you came late!

00:21:32.840 --> 00:21:33.930
I’m sorry.

00:21:33.930 --> 00:21:36.930
Rebecca still has much to improve.

00:21:37.000 --> 00:21:38.610
You’re one to talk!

00:21:39.240 --> 00:21:40.440
Sorry.

00:21:59.070 --> 00:22:13.690
Right now, we don't need a map

00:22:13.850 --> 00:22:29.410
The miracle that tore through the darkness is in my hand

00:22:30.130 --> 00:22:35.250
Without a goal in mind

00:22:36.570 --> 00:22:43.820
We just step towards our dream

00:22:44.210 --> 00:22:49.460
EYE'S  As you sense it

00:22:49.650 --> 00:22:57.930
Your eye will find it

00:22:58.290 --> 00:23:03.740
